### Health check
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### All books
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books

### Filter by status and title
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books?status=done&q=dune

### One book
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books/b1

### Unknown book (404)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/books/nope

### Create a book (201)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Neuromancer",
  "author": "William Gibson",
  "status": "reading",
  "rating": null
}

### Create without an author (400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "No author"
}

### Create with a rating of 6 (400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Too good",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "rating": 6
}

### Replace a book (200)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/books/b3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gone Girl",
  "author": "Gillian Flynn",
  "status": "done",
  "rating": 4,
  "notes": "Finished it in two days."
}

### Delete a book (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/books/b2

### Unknown route (404)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/nope
